YORIK APP SDK LINKING EXCEPTION
================================

Version 1.0, 2026-05-22


This is an additional permission granted on top of the GNU Affero
General Public License (AGPL-3.0-or-later) under which Yorik is
distributed (see ./LICENSE).

It applies specifically and only to:

  backend/app_sdk.py

and to any future module the Yorik maintainers explicitly mark as
part of the App SDK by including a SPDX header reading:

  SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later WITH Yorik-App-SDK-Exception-1.0

The intent is to allow third-party application developers to build
Yorik apps WITHOUT the AGPL's copyleft requirement reaching their
own code, so that commercial, proprietary, and differently-licensed
apps can coexist with open-source ones in the Yorik ecosystem.


GRANT
-----

