AGPL-3.0-or-later (matching the rest of the Yorik project under
DCO). By submitting a patch to the App SDK, you grant the Yorik
maintainers permission to distribute it under the AGPL-3.0-or-later
together with this exception. If you do not wish your patch to be
distributed under this combined license, do not submit it.
